lure is the DUT's undefined (x) value at t=0 / first edge, while the reference presents a defined 0. Add initialization of Q to 0.\n\nLet me edit."}},{"type":"block-end","index":1,"block":{"type":"text","text":"The functional logic matches the spec (2:1 mux + flop selected by `L`). The single mismatch is the DUT's undefined `Q` before the first clock edge, while the reference presents a defined initial value. I'll initialize the register to a defined 0."}},{"type":"block-end","index":2,"block":{"type":"tool-call","id":"call_00_4Hn4pwpQU5K227wID5cv0841","name":"edit_dut","arguments":"{\"expected_revision_id\": \"6d2d564a-0ceb-4c8b-8c45-093a39225293\", \"source\": \"\\nmodule TopModule (\\n    input  clk,\\n    input  L,\\n    input  q_in,\\n    input  r_in,\\n    output reg Q\\n);\\n\\n    // Defined power-up state so Q is not 'x' before the first clock edge.\\n    initial Q = 1'b0;\\n\\n    always @(posedge clk) begin\\n        if (L)\\n            Q <= r_in;\\n        else\\n            Q <= q_in;\\n    end\\n\\nendmodule\\n\"}"}},{"type":"usage","usage":{"inputTokens":6822,"outputTokens":279,"totalTokens":8253,"cacheReadTokens":1152,"reasoningTokens":42}},{"type":"finish","reason":{"kind":"tool-calls"}}]